erred without evidence, including H13 through H18, H30 through H33, H36, H41, and H165 through H167. The principal inferential uncertainty is whether feature_063 has a stable threshold-precise magnitude when several high-value strata are combined, and whether feature_003 can be localized in a cleaner core-negative high feature_030 context. Small-cell contrasts and untested categorical levels remain unresolved.\n\nNext analysis. I registered three focused discovery proposals: feature_063 within clean core-negative eligibility with feature_053>=10 and feature_051>=2.6735; feature_063 within clean core-negative eligibility with feature_040>=-7.353 and feature_051>=2.6735; and feature_003 within clean core-negative eligibility with feature_030>=8. If only one block is pursued, prioritize feature_063 clean high-numeric strata because that is the most informative way to decide whether feature_063 remains merely directional or can be threshold precise in a narrower population. All conclusions remain dataset-only associations; no causal, biological, coding-level, single-gene-knockout, or external generalizability claim is supported.",
