wo proposals address feature_003, which remains narrow and not clearly broad. Prior core-negative feature_063-negative feature_003 estimates were positive but threshold borderline. If high feature_053 is informative, feature_003 may become threshold in that context; otherwise it remains a weak directional marker. These analyses are dataset-only associations and do not support causal, biological, coding-level, single-gene-knockout, or generalizability claims. Priority is to analyze active H247 and H249 plus these paired-context feature_063 interactions, then the feature_003 high-feature_053 comparisons if analysis capacity remains.",
